+## Briij XRPL CLI example
+
+This fork includes a small CLI example binary, `briij-cli`, that can perform
+native XRPL/Xahau wallet login against a TextRP-Briij homeserver using the
+custom Matrix login type `org.textrp.login.xrpl`.
+
+The CLI reads the wallet seed from the environment and never stores or
+transmits it to the homeserver.
+
+```bash
+export BRIJJ_XRPL_SEED="sEd..."
+cargo run --bin briij-cli -- login-xrpl --homeserver https://test-server.textrp.io --network xrpl
+```
+
+After a successful login, the session is persisted locally. You can print the
+linked wallet address from that persisted session with:
+
+```bash
+cargo run --bin briij-cli -- address
+```
+
